-------------------------------| Help message for Kraken2 module
|------------------------------------- 
HCC has already downloaded a few Kraken2 databases.
Their location can be accessed via the following environment variables:
$KRAKEN2_STANDARD_DB, $KRAKEN2_VIRAL_DB, $KRAKEN2_CORE_NT_DB,
$KRAKEN2_PLUSPF_DB, $KRAKEN2_PLUSPFP_DB 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
For example, to run Kraken2 with the Viral database, please use:
'kraken2 --db $KRAKEN2_VIRAL_DB <other options> <my_sequence_file.fa>'
